1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,088
This Father's Day

2
00:00:01,090 --> 00:00:03,928
I prepared a special gift for my dad

3
00:00:04,009 --> 00:00:07,488
I chose a nice tie because he wears one to work every day

4
00:00:07,730 --> 00:00:08,648
In the morning

5
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:12,489
I gave him the gift and he was very happy and hugged me

6
00:00:12,769 --> 00:00:16,248
We had breakfast together and then went to the park

7
00:00:16,489 --> 00:00:19,888
Dad took me to play on the slides and swings

8
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:21,768
We had a lot of fun that day

9
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:25,048
Seeing my dad so happy made me happy too

10
00:00:25,129 --> 00:00:27,849
Father's Day is a great chance to show love

11
00:00:28,129 --> 00:00:30,048
I love my dad very much

